Added helpers in `sc.voltolighttheme.utils.themes` to create and delete Color Groups and Block Themes. Custom ones are copied to every theme on the site, the base Color Groups (`primary`, `secondary`, `accent`, `neutral`) and Block Themes (`default`, `alternative`) cannot be deleted, deleting a Color Group points the Block Themes using it back to `primary`, and missing theme records are registered on demand. The `initial` profile sets up the Christmas (`natal`) theme colors. @Humanaice
